items.source:
Simple static factory method to add some syntactic sugar around a UpdateOperation. For example:

<pre class="code">UpdateSpecification&lt;User&gt; updateLastname = UpdateOperation
                .&lt;User&gt; update((root, update, criteriaBuilder) -&gt; update.set("lastname", "Heisenberg"))
                .where(userHasFirstname("Walter").and(userHasLastname("White")));

repository.update(updateLastname);
</pre>

